# Documentation only: shell environment files are NEVER loaded by this ISO.
# The sole deploy-time input is base64 JSON fetched from the fixed endpoint
# http://169.254.169.254/v1/user-data. It contains exactly:
# {"case_id":"case-0000","token":"ONE-TIME-TOKEN",
#  "control_plane":"http://192.0.2.10:8000",
#  "vpc_subnet":"192.0.2.0/24","vpc_ip":"192.0.2.20"}
# Python validates IDs, IPv4 CIDR membership and control-plane IPv4:port.
# Invalid input yields drop-only egress and the twin agent never starts.
